&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Customer Success Manager oversees a portfolio of accounts and ensures an amazing customer experience, as measured by NPS, net revenue retention, referrals and product usage indicators.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
